{"id":2088,"level":79,"name":"Відкритий напад (2)","group":"Практика","format":27,"description":"<p><span style='font-weight: 400;'>The discovered attack remains one of the most important chess tricks. So we will continue to practice. When two pieces of the same color are aligned, they form a battery. By moving the piece in front, the view of the back piece (bishop, rook or queen) opens up. You can suddenly attack two pieces at the same time.</span></p>  <p></p>  <p><b>What do you have to do?</b></p>  <p><span style='font-weight: 400;'>Win material by performing a discovered attack.&nbsp;</span></p>","assignment":"","stickerID":0,"examples":[{"fen":"3r2k1/pp1nr1p1/2p3Q1/3p1R2/3P4/7P/PPq3P1/R6K w - - 0 25","pgn":"{[#]} 25. Rf8+ {[%csl Rc2,Gf8,Gg6,Rg8][%cal Gg6c2,Gf8g8]} Rxf8 26. Qxc2 * ","text":"<p>Уважно стеж за фігурами, які стоять на одній лінії. Після <strong>1.Rf8+! </strong>білі виграють чорного ферзя.</p>","format":27},{"fen":"r7/8/2k2p2/2p1p2P/2P1P2P/p2P4/3K4/R2B3r w - - 0 45","pgn":"45. Ba4+ {[%csl Ga1,Ga4,Rc6,Rh1][%cal Ga4c6,Ga1h1]} Rxa4 46. Rxh1 * ","text":"<p>Віддавши чек, білі можуть виграти матеріал із відкритим нападом. Ендшпіль, що залишився, дуже перспективний для білих.</p>","format":27},{"fen":"6k1/p2R1p1p/1p4p1/3b4/8/P2r1PP1/1P4KP/5R2 b - - 0 29","pgn":"29... Bxf3+ {[%csl Gd3,Rd7,Gf3,Rg2][%cal Gd3d7,Gf3g2]} 30. Rxf3 Rxd7 * ","text":"<p>D-вертикаль заповнений фігурами. З<strong> 1...Bxf3+! </strong>Чорний створює потужну відкритий напад.</p>","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":77734,"fen":"3r1r2/4b1kp/1q2bpp1/1p6/p2PpP2/P3B3/1PQN2PP/3RR2K w - - 0 26","pgn":"{[%csl Rb6][%evp 0,3,325,310,298,290]} {Q=1} 26. d5 Qb7 27. dxe6 * ","format":27,"texts":["Білий слон дивиться на свого пішака й бачить чорного ферзя!"],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":77743,"fen":"5r2/5pkp/1nNn1qp1/1p1p4/1P1P4/4P1PP/1Q3PB1/R5K1 b - - 0 26","pgn":"{[%csl Rc6][%evp 0,3,-240,-262,-255,-261]} {Q=1} 26... Ndc4 27. Qc3 Qxc6 * ","format":27,"texts":["The black queen eyes over its own knight and sees a white knight."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":77749,"fen":"r2qk1nr/1pp2ppp/p1pb4/8/3QP3/2N2P1P/PPP2P2/R1B2RK1 b kq - 0 10","pgn":"{[%csl Rd4][%evp 0,3,-624,-649,-645,-627]} {Q=1} 10... Bh2+ 11. Kxh2 Qxd4 * ","format":27,"texts":["The black queen eyes over her own bishop and spots a white queen!"],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":77746,"fen":"r1b1r1k1/ppq2p2/6pp/3pb3/8/2P1B1P1/PPQ1P1BP/R2R2K1 b - - 0 20","pgn":"{[%csl Re3][%evp 0,3,-179,-196,-256,-278]} {Q=1} 20... Bxg3 21. hxg3 Rxe3 * ","format":27,"texts":["«Навіть виграш пішака є приємним результатом відкритого нападу»."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":77741,"fen":"r1bq1rk1/ppp1b1pp/2n1p3/3pPn2/3P1B2/2P2NN1/PP4PP/R2QKB1R b KQ - 0 11","pgn":"{[%csl Rf4][%evp 0,3,-162,-110,-103,-113]} {Q=1} 11... Nfxd4 12. cxd4 Rxf4 * ","format":27,"texts":["«Навіть виграш пішака є приємним результатом відкритого нападу»."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":77737,"fen":"r3k2r/ppp2ppp/2n1pq2/2b5/2Pp4/1P4P1/P2PPPBP/RN1QK1NR b KQkq - 0 9","pgn":"{[%csl Ra1][%evp 0,3,-117,-126,-163,-152]} {Q=1} 9... d3 10. e3 Qxa1 * ","format":27,"texts":["Pawn f2 is weak and the rook in the corner is hanging."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":77744,"fen":"r2k1r2/pp1b2p1/2p2b1p/5B2/8/2N5/PPP3PP/2KR3R b - - 0 17","pgn":"{[%csl Rf5][%evp 0,3,-356,-374,-376,-371]} {Q=1} 17... Bg5+ 18. Kb1 Rxf5 * ","format":27,"texts":["The black rook eyes over its own bishop and sees a white bishop."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":77736,"fen":"r4rk1/4qp1p/pp2pRp1/3b2B1/3p4/3P2Q1/PP4PP/4R2K w - - 0 22","pgn":"{[%csl Re7][%evp 0,3,410,386,564,650]} {Q=1} 22. Rxg6+ hxg6 23. Bxe7 * ","format":27,"texts":["The white bishop eyes over the rook and spots a black queen!"],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":77748,"fen":"r1bqr1k1/ppp2pbp/3p1np1/8/2PQP3/2N5/PP3PPP/R1B1RBK1 b - - 0 11","pgn":"{[%csl Rd4][%evp 0,1,-193,-185]} {Q=1} 11... Nxe4 * ","format":27,"text